# 1. Initialize 1-store cluster
# 2. Flush
# 3. Split (lhs=1, rhs=2)
# 4. Flush both ranges
# 5. Verify RSEngine state for both ranges
# 6. Merge ranges back
# 7. Verify RSEngine state after merge

init stores=1
